OL,5,G0600 James Martin's Islands to
OL,6,G     Highlands
OL,7,     FThe chef is joined by Nick Nairn
OL,8,     Ffor a trip aboard luxury train the
OL,9,     FRoyal Scotsman, with James
OL,10,     Fvisiting the train's kitchens to
OL,11,     Fprepare a traditional duck a
